# goneat ignore patterns for rsfulmen
# Excludes files that must not be formatted / linted / validated by goneat.
# Syntax is gitignore-style (supports ! negation). Loaded by goneat assess,
# format, and validate in addition to .gitignore.

# Deliberately malformed / invalid test fixtures synced from Crucible.
# These are intentionally non-conformant (parse-failure and invalid-value
# negative-test cases) and must NOT be "fixed" by goneat format or flagged
# by lint. Mirrors crucible's own .goneatignore (standard galaxy protocol),
# adjusted for the crucible-rs synced-asset prefix.
config/crucible-rs/repository/app-identity/fixtures/invalid/
config/crucible-rs/library/foundry/fixtures/signals/invalid/
